    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A compact electroshock emitter fitted to the weapon's frame near the barrel that discharges on contact during a pistol-whip or frame strike. The charge is calibrated to disrupt nervous system function without lethal effect, creating a brief window of incapacitation that operatives can exploit. Designed for pistols. When you Strike with a pistol as a melee weapon and hit, the target is flat-footed until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a pistol.</p>"
